@startuml
!include ../docs/images/common-sequence.iuml

title Archive Processor — RabbitMQ Queue-Depth High-Water Mark

box "Archive Processor" $OnPrem
    participant "Archiver" as Archiver
end box

box "RabbitMQ" $OnPrem
    queue "archive" as ArchiveQ
end box

box "MQTT" $OnPrem
    participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
end box

== Every 10 seconds, independent of telemetry_interval_seconds ==

loop until shutdown
    Archiver -> Archiver : **Sleep 10 seconds**
    alt consumer channel connected
        Archiver -> ArchiveQ++ : **Read queue depth**\n""queue_declare(queue=archive, durable=True, passive=True)""
        ArchiveQ --> Archiver-- : message_count
        Archiver -> Archiver : **Record into high-water mark**\n""hwm.record(message_count)""
    else not connected yet, or declare raises
        Archiver -> Archiver : **Record into high-water mark**\n""hwm.record(-1)""
    end
end

== Independently, every telemetry_interval_seconds ==

Archiver -> Archiver : **Read and reset the high-water mark**\n""depth_hwm = hwm.value_and_reset()""
Archiver -\ MQTT : **Publish telemetry**\n""SkyFollower/archive/statistics"" (retain=True)\nincludes rabbitmq_archive_queue_depth_hwm

@enduml
